  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As per vrchat's recent stance on ai:\n\n\"What about filters so I can completely turn off this content?\n\nWe’re not adding them. Filters get set once and forgotten, and then you never see that part of VRChat again.\"\n\n feel that you are absolutely right, users should experience everything vrchat has to offer. To that end I recommend we remove the block feature. After all, a blocked user gets blocked once and then forgotten about, and you never see that part of vrchat again! That goes against vrchat's philosophy!\n\nPlease fix this oversight.",
